OL,3,AWhite House restores access to media
OL,4,Aoutlets banned by Trump after judge's
OL,5,Aorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FCNN, Politico and MS NOW reporters have
OL,8,Fbeen allowed back into the White House
OL,9,Fafter they sought an emergency court
OL,10,Fhearing to restore their revoked press
OL,11,Faccess.
OL,13,FThey accused the White House in a court
OL,14,Ffiling of having "repeatedly violated"
OL,15,Fa judge's order lifting President
OL,16,FDonald Trump's ban on the three media
OL,17,Foutlets.
OL,19,FBut the White House said in a filing
OL,20,Fthat it began reinstating access
OL,21,Fshortly after 09:00 EDT (13:00 GMT) on
OL,22,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
