OL,3,AWhite House restores access to media
OL,4,Aoutlets banned by Trump after judge's
OL,5,Aorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FCNN, MS NOW and Politico reported they
OL,8,Fwere granted entry hours after some of
OL,9,Ftheir staff were turned away. Trump
OL,10,Finitially said he barred the outlets
OL,11,Fbecause of "fake news". The White House
OL,12,Flater cited national security.
